     "annotation": "Before talking to anyone we walked the existing deskbird app end to end, once as an admin and once as an end user, mapping its user flows and its existing social surface — annotating every screen against Nielsen's heuristics, colour-coded by which one was in question. In parallel we reviewed two landscapes: the engagement-platform set (Microsoft Viva Engage, Workvivo, Happeo, Haiilo, Staffbase, Donut for Slack, Sococo, Gather Town and others) and deskbird's direct desk-booking competitors (Flexopus, Deskly, Kadence, Seatti, Envoy, Yoffix and others), feature by feature.",
